  "Header": "MMC-SIR-V2.5",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Speaker Identity Recognition: receives a Basic Speech Object, which carries the time it was acquired, and, optionally, the Basic Audio Scene Descriptors of the scene it was isolated from; matches the speaker against the Subject Gallery held in Shared Storage; and returns the speaker identity as an Instance Identifier - the coarse \"speech\" layer when nobody matches, so that an identity is always returned for the speech received. The audio counterpart of Face Identity Recognition. Instance for Television Media Analysis: the Auxiliary Text raises the candidates named in it; the Speech Overlap is noted.",
